{"action_id":null,"arguments":[],"assumptions":[{"assumption_id":"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249.a0","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The assessed provider is treated as a distributor only after its role in distributing the relevant funds has been established.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249.a1","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Gift status requires a substantive classification of the particular benefit. The statement that guaranteed returns or other incentives may be considered gifts does not make every such return or incentive a gift automatically.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249.a2","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Fee-or-charge-discount status applies to the substance of the assessed component, not merely to the label used for the combined offer.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249.a3","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"Separately identifiable benefits are assessed separately. Where an arrangement cannot reliably be decomposed, component boundaries require judgment before this model can be applied.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249.a4","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The particular-product-type relationship includes the source's examples of certain types of funds and funds offered by certain fund houses.","status":"PROVISIONAL"},{"assumption_id":"node.142f34016b300f5c110eb249.a5","provenance_refs":[],"statement":"The result concerns only the quoted paragraph 3.11 gift restriction and confers no legal approval.","status":"PROVISIONAL"}],"bundle_hash":"586262f99ee83fde1c3e2ce14d1c1cdaae0c433909759b87f05d0fa36db9435a","candidate_id":"candidate.c645662376e842e98ef3e254bfe1fc93","controlled_language":"[TRUE_IS_PROHIBITED] For an assessed distributor within scope, the result answers whether offering this particular benefit component to the client falls within the quoted gift restriction: the component is offered in promoting a specific investment product or a particular type of investment product, is classified as a gift, and is not a discount of fees or charges. True means that this component's offer falls within that restriction. False means that the conjunction is not met for this component; it does not establish that the combined offer is compliant or legally approved. Unknown inputs remain unknown unless the expression can be determined from the other inputs.","disposition_reason":"Unreviewed interpretation proposal","family_ids":["exceptions"],"generation_phase":"BLIND_INITIAL","issue_ids":["issue.1eddeaea51b14cce98bf650275acc657","issue.c8770fdccad943dd98f0782519ef045b","issue.4f15797095794d7a9e3cf7bc52b1ba6b","issue.a7f5a0fba5144796a782377f9cd3c4ce","issue.087521710beb467897d524866365169d","issue.ec22e0b434fe49328428938811ae1c9a"],"parent_id":null,"probability_of_legal_correctness":null,"revision_reason":"A single offer-level Boolean such as 'contains a discount' would hide separate benefits and could incorrectly extend the discount exception to an accompanying gift. A Boolean limited to promotion of a named fund would also miss promotion of a fund type or funds from a particular fund house. Finally, 'guaranteed return' cannot stand in for 'gift': the source distinguishes fund return from distributor top-up and uses qualified gift-classification language.","run_id":"run.5536e2694ccd404aa5c8cf55fdd1443e","scheduling_priority":0,"schema_version":"interpretation.v1","score_purpose":"INVESTIGATION_PRIORITY_ONLY","source_packet_hash":"9cc272f84dbcec164f1a7a7a567859d8a6feb7fc34af22d7bef3e7688f64f736","source_unit_ids":["db43e253bea18.u0.2","db43e253bea18.u12.2646","db43e253bea18.u13.2987","db43e253bea18.u7.1360"],"status":"ACTIVE","subject_unit":"Application of the gift restriction to one component of a product or product-type promotion"}